Subject: [PATCH] Add Market Ready bridge and rework donate form (needs
 sign-off)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- TIER_LABELS rendered under each tier bar in T.I.E.R. Breakdown
- Market Ready card: counts good-condition Reserve-tier apparel items,
  excluding distributed/closed stages. Scoped to recentItems only (no
  full-inventory endpoint exists yet) — directional, not exact; labeled
  as such in the UI. 'Create market draft' is disabled pending a real
  /market/draft/new route.
- Donate.tsx trimmed to 5 fields (what/how many/condition/pickup-or-
  dropoff/contact). Contact reuses the donorName field since there's no
  dedicated contact column — visible to staff on review, not wired to
  any notification. Removed expiry/temperature/weight/category/origin/
  notes inputs per the 5-field spec; flagging that capability loss here
  since it's a real tradeoff, not just a bug.
- Softened the success message to drop the unbuilt routing-time/
  notification promise ('routed by tomorrow... note when it moves').

Needs your sign-off on the tradeoffs above before merging.
